  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Family Sweater",
    "overview": "A sweater-red phone app. Everything you read and press sits on flat yarn blocks whose colour says what they are: yarn white for information, gold for the one thing to do now, pine for yours or only-you, oat rose for taken. Stitched lettering is kept for names, numbers and moments. The one authored moment is the reveal: hold the knitted gift, it unravels, the yarn knits your person's name, the ground turns pine, and the name stays knitted on a pine pass at the top of Home and Family.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Flat sweater-red ground; pine only for private screens.",
      "Yarn-block cards with colour meaning, always said in words too.",
      "One type scale, one 20px edge, one icon set, one sheet, one toast, one mode banner.",
      "Stitches only for names, numbers and moments.",
      "No shadows, borders or edge bands.",
      "Motion behaves like yarn."
    ]
  }
}